<H1 ALIGN=CENTER> The Salve Matrix    </H1>
<BLOCKQUOTE>
<br><hr><br>

<pre>

These are combinations that have been tried.  Some of this dates back to 
Gurb's work in 2001 and 2002, and later by Alkor.  I have been working 
to expand the tables.

A white salve means a failed test; it has no effects.

Skill %      Bonus
------------------------------
97           +24 to some stats
58           +17 to some stats


New Salve combos
----------------------------
protect item         starmetal      blueberry



Salve             Effect
-------------------------------
blue poison       mildly poisonous (one poison tick of 39, then nothing more)
blue poison       mildly poisonous (ticks of 30 25 30 81 17 18 etc).  And +vulner to poison/toxin
indigo +con       gives +20 con, or 60 hps., lasted for 10 min.
cyan +wis         +41 sps
magenta +wis      gives +41 sps (usually +2 to +3 sps per +1 wis) so about +16 wis
yellow +wis        
red poison        mildly poisonous (poison ticks of 41 16 17 63 49 40 53 15, etc)



